cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ShotTx"
abstract: >-
  ShotTx is the tableau component of Shot, a concurrent automated theorem prover
  for higher-order logic (Church's simple type theory) on the BEAM. It
  implements a parallel, actor-based refutation search with iterative deepening,
  Skolemisation, primitive substitution and demodulation on top of ShotDs,
  ShotUn and ShotTo, and includes proof reconstruction, a TPTP benchmark runner
  and an ablation harness.
